=== CREATIVE STRUCTURE ===
#3-cycles = k(k-1) = 2*C(k,2)
#5-cycles = k(k-1)(k-2)(k+3)/6 = C(k,3)*(k+3)

Interesting ratio: #5/#3 = C(k,3)*(k+3) / (k*(k-1))
